I got to know about two new tools they are: 1.ffmpeg & 2.qrencode
1.ffmpeg:
    It used to extract the frames from the videos at particular time.
    The command to extract the frames is:
    ->ffmpeg -i <inputfile> -frames:v <outputfile>
    To find the frame at particular time is:
    ->ffmpeg -i <inputfile> -t "HH:MM:SS" <outputfile>
    To make the extracted frame into gif the command is:
    ->ffmpeg -i <inputfile> -t "HH:MM:SS" <outputfile.gif>
    And the flag -vf is used to filters for fps and scale.

2.qrencode:
    It geneartes the QR code
    The command:
    ->qrencode -o <filename(output)> "URL"